# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values. Never commit `.env*` files.

## Supabase (required)

```bash
# Project URL, e.g. https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=

# Publishable/anon key (safe for the browser). Any one of the three key
# variables below is enough — the app checks them in this order:
#   1. NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_DEFAULT_KEY
#   2. NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#   3. NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
```

## API (optional)

```bash
# Backend API base URL (defaults to https://infra.agripath.co)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=

# Payment API base URL (defaults to https://infra.agripath.co/api/payments)
NEXT_PUBLIC_PAYMENT_API_URL=
```

## Storage (optional)

```bash
# Supabase Storage host used for image optimization.
# Defaults to the host of NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL, then to the
# production project host.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_STORAGE_HOST=
```

## Local tooling (optional)

```bash
# Used by .cursor/mcp.json for the read-only Supabase MCP server.
# Generate in Supabase Dashboard > Account Settings > Access Tokens.
SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF=
```
